[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11223.03, "timestamp": "03:07:03", "text": "奇怪的事情。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11225.349, "timestamp": "03:07:05", "text": "我觉得你好像搞混了。现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11227.349, "timestamp": "03:07:07", "text": "它运行正常，对吧？因为我听到了你的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11229.19, "timestamp": "03:07:09", "text": "说：“我的天哪，它奏效了。”我听说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11230.63, "timestamp": "03:07:10", "text": "你说得对。我当时就想，“好吧。”是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11234.87, "timestamp": "03:07:14", "text": "是。是的，终于。我的天哪。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11236.349, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "text": "也拓展了业务范围。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11239.67, "timestamp": "03:07:19", "text": "很多。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11252.07, "timestamp": "03:07:32", "text": "他妈的？总之，快去吃饭吧。离开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11254.469, "timestamp": "03:07:34", "text": "这里。真是见鬼了。你好。你好。你好。做你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11257.19, "timestamp": "03:07:37", "text": "流媒体功能，这样我就可以设置这个了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11260.03, "timestamp": "03:07:40", "text": "哦，是的。我把那件事忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11263.03, "timestamp": "03:07:43", "text": "难道只有我一个忍者吗？没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11266.71, "timestamp": "03:07:46", "text": "美好的。他是个男的。他是个男的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11270.59, "timestamp": "03:07:50", "text": "好的。我的意思是，他可以随便叫我什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11273.19, "timestamp": "03:07:53", "text": "就像我是一个相关性，所以是性别"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11275.11, "timestamp": "03:07:55", "text": "我觉得这不适用于我。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11277.11, "timestamp": "03:07:57", "text": "知道。"}]